  c. No commercial use. You may not use the Software, or any derivative
     work, for commercial purposes, including selling it, offering it as
     part of a paid product or service, or using it inside a commercial
     organization's products, without prior written permission from the
     copyright holder.

  d. No AI Training. You may not use the Software, or any portion of it,
     for AI Training. This prohibition is absolute: it applies to every
     kind of use, including personal, hobby, educational, academic,
     research, and other Non-Commercial Use, and regardless of whether
     the Software was obtained directly, through a mirror, scraping, or any
     other means.

  e. Framework Use is allowed for Non-Commercial Use only. Framework Use,
     as defined above, is not AI Training and is permitted under this
     license, subject to conditions (a) to (c). Models you train through
     Framework Use, and the data the Software generates while running, are
     not restricted by condition (d), but they may be used only for
     Non-Commercial Use. Training, running, or deploying such models for
     commercial purposes requires prior written permission from the
     copyright holder.

  f. No AI Replication. You may not use the Software, or any portion of
     it, for AI Replication, for any purpose, including Non-Commercial Use.
     A work produced by AI Replication is treated as a derivative work of
     the Software and remains subject to all terms of this license.

  g. AI-Assisted Modification is allowed for Non-Commercial Use. You may
     clone or fork the Software and use AI tools to help you modify it,
     subject to conditions (a) to (c). Giving parts of the Software to an
     AI tool as context for this purpose is not AI Training under
     condition (d), provided that you do not knowingly permit the tool's
     provider to use the Software for AI Training (for example, you must
     turn off any setting that lets the provider train on your inputs,
     where such a setting exists).

